Review this retry helper for an open-source CLI I maintain:

```go
func Retry(attempts int, base time.Duration, fn func() error) error {
	var err error
	for i := 0; i < attempts; i++ {
		if err = fn(); err == nil {
			return nil
		}
		time.Sleep(base << uint(i))
	}
	return err
}
```
